{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2022-09-22 11:04:00', 'title': 'MARSH MCLENNAN DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.590 PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON OCTOBER 7, 2022. ABOUT MARSH MCLENNAN MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) IS THE WORLD'S LEADING PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM IN THE AREAS OF RISK, STRATEGY AND PEOPLE. THE COMPANY'S 83,000 COLLEAGUES ADVISE CLIENTS IN 130 COUNTRIES. WITH ANNUAL REVENUE OF APPROXIMATELY $20 BILLION, MA"}{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2022-09-22 08:00:00', 'title': 'MARSH CLIENTS CAN NOW PAY FEES USING CARBON CREDITS AND RENEWABLE ENERGY CERTIFICATES', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MARSH, THE WORLD'S LEADING INSURANCE BROKER AND RISK ADVISOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT US CLIENTS NOW HAVE THE OPTION TO PAY THEIR MARSH SERVICE FEES IN VOLUNTARY CARBON OFFSET CREDITS AND RENEWABLE ENERGY CERTIFICATES (RECS). THE MOVE — BELIEVED TO BE A FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND IN THE FINANCIAL SERVICES INDUSTRY — IS PART OF MARSH'S COMMITMENT TO HELP ACCELERATE THE ENERGY TRANSITION FROM FOSSIL FUELS TO RENEWABLES AND TO RECOGNIZE CLIENTS PURSUING AND EXCEEDING NET ZERO CARBON"}